Z||000011||Songman||06-20-2001||12:11 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Black88GT:<BR><B>I'm not debating either way whether he is right or wrong.  It just seems everytime I come to the O/T section I see it posted again.  I mean, give it a rest.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>My point is so what if you have seen it a hundred times.. There are new people on the board everyday that may not have seen it. I have been here almost the same amount of time as you (and have not been in near the amount of trouble! heheh) and I had never seen it... And even if I had, it bears repeating. There is a lot of truth in what it says. All you gotta do it move on over it if you don't like it.. I do that everyday with posts that don't interest me but might interest others... I am sure we all do.<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
